<title>USA: Class action suit filed against WebSecure.</title>
<headline>Class action suit filed against WebSecure.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>A class action suit has been filed against WebSecure Inc accusing the company of violating securities laws by misstating technology it acquired and other actions, plaintiff's lawyers said Thursday.</p>
<p>The suit was filed Wednesday in the United States District Court for the District of Massachusetts for buyers of WebSecure securities from December 5 through February 27, attorneys from the law firms of Weiss &amp; Yourman and Stull, Stull &amp; Brody said.</p>
</text>
